M(gcan, r"""
public static long wetLen(long base, int n) {
  if (n <= 0 || base <= 0L) return base;
  double f = Math.pow(1.0 - @PKG@.GearCfg.CAN_REW / 100.0, (double) n);
  double fl = @PKG@.GearCfg.CAN_WFLOOR / 100.0;
  if (f < fl) f = fl;
  long l = (long) Math.floor((double) base * f + 1e-6);          // + 1e-6: 10800 x 0.85^2 = 7803, not 7802.99..
  if (l < 60L) l = 60L;
  return l > base ? base : l;
}""")
